cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KAIROS Observatory, its dataset or its forecasts, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KAIROS Observatory: an open early-warning system for runaway AI"
abstract: >-
  KAIROS watches AI capability C(t) against human oversight capacity H(t) and
  reports four dials (acceleration, recursion, Vinge Horizon, Jonas Gap) that
  feed pre-agreed tripwire levels. Prophet and NeuralProphet act as null models,
  singularity detectors look for super-exponential growth, and every forecast is
  pre-registered in a hash-chained public ledger.
